@startuml
title HydroModPy - Code-Level (Literal) : modules et fonctions
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 140

package "Entrées" <<entry>> {
  component "hydromodpy.cli" as CLI
  component "hydromodpy.__init__ (API)" as API
}

package "Facade / Projet" {
  component "hydromodpy.project.Project" as Project
  component "hydromodpy.project_runner.ProjectRunner" as ProjectRunner
  component "hydromodpy.project_catalog.ProjectCatalog" as ProjectCatalog
}

package "Workflow / Orchestration" {
  component "hydromodpy.workflow.dispatch" as Dispatch
  component "hydromodpy.workflow.orchestrator" as Orchestrator
  component "hydromodpy.workflow.runner.Pipeline" as Pipeline
}

package "Calibration / Orchestration" {
  component "hydromodpy.calibration_dispatch" as CalibrationDispatch
  component "hydromodpy.calibration.engine.CalibrationEngine" as CalibrationEngine
  component "hydromodpy.calibration.runners.trial.run_trial_light" as TrialRunner
  component "hydromodpy.calibration.runners.trial.promote_prepared_trial" as TrialPromote
  component "hydromodpy.calibration.optimizer.Optimizer" as CalibrationOptimizer
}

package "Simulation" {
  component "hydromodpy.simulation.execution.runner.SimulationRunner" as SimRunner
  component "hydromodpy.workflow.launcher_protocol.Launcher (Protocol)" as LauncherProto
}

package "Results & Data" {
  component "hydromodpy.results.catalog.facade.SimulationCatalog" as SimulationCatalog
  component "hydromodpy.results.catalog.protocol.SimulationStore (Protocol)" as SimulationStoreProto
  component "hydromodpy.data.store.DataStore" as DataStore
  component "hydromodpy.data._base_manager_common.SourceConfigProtocol (Protocol)" as SourceConfigProto
}

package "Solveurs / Adapters" {
  component "hydromodpy.core.contracts.solver_registry.SolverRegistryProvider (Protocol)" as SolverRegistryProto
  component "hydromodpy.solver.base.protocol.SolverAdapter (Protocol)" as SolverAdapterProto
  component "adapters / solver backends" as SolverBackends
}

' Flux principal (fonctions exactes)
CLI --> Dispatch : hmp run / hydromodpy.cli.main()
API --> Project : hydromodpy.Project.from_toml() / hydromodpy.run()
Dispatch --> Orchestrator : hydromodpy.workflow.dispatch.dispatch_workflow()
API --> CalibrationDispatch : hydromodpy.calibrate() / calibrate_api()
CalibrationDispatch --> CalibrationEngine : hydromodpy.calibration_dispatch.*
CalibrationEngine --> CalibrationOptimizer : ask/tell loop
CalibrationEngine --> TrialRunner : evaluate suggestions
CalibrationDispatch --> TrialPromote : promote_prepared_trial()

' Orchestrator API exactes
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : prepare_runtime(ctx)
note right: calls step_setup(), step_data_loading(), step_mesh(), step_mesh_input()
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : prepare_run(ctx, sim_id, name, overrides)
note right: calls step_build_plan(), step_register_simulation(), step_persist_*()
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : execute_run(ctx, sim_id, final_name)
note right: calls SimulationRunner.execute(plan, ctx, callbacks)
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : ingest_run(ctx, sim_id)
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : render_run(ctx, sim_id)
ProjectRunner --> Orchestrator : cleanup_run(ctx, sim_id)

' Pipeline sequence (standard_steps)
Orchestrator --> Pipeline : standard_steps()
Pipeline --> "Validate" : ValidateStep()
"Validate" --> "Resolve" : ResolveStep()
"Resolve" --> "BuildGeographic" : BuildGeographicStep()
"BuildGeographic" --> "LoadData" : BuildGeographicStep invokes geographic builders
"LoadData" --> DataStore : DataStore.load_variable(config)
"LoadData" --> "BuildMesh" : LoadDataStep -> BuildMeshStep
"BuildMesh" --> SimulationCatalog : step_persist_mesh(ctx, sim_id)
"BuildMesh" --> "SetupProcess" : SetupProcessStep()
"SetupProcess" --> "PrepareSolver" : PrepareSolverStep()
"PrepareSolver" --> SimulationCatalog : step_register_simulation(ctx, sim_id, plan, project_name, name)
"PrepareSolver" --> "RunSolver" : RunSolverStep()

' Exécution réelle
"RunSolver" -( LauncherProto : requires Launcher (Launcher.execute))
SimRunner -() LauncherProto : provides execute(plan, ctx, callbacks)
SimRunner -( SolverRegistryProto : calls SolverRegistryProvider.get_solver_adapter(process_type, solver_name))
SolverRegistryProto -() SolverAdapterProto : get_solver_adapter_class()/get_solver_adapter()
SolverAdapterProto --> SolverBackends : adapter.execute(ctx) -> invokes solver backend
SolverBackends --> SimRunner : solver outputs (files, arrays)

' Extraction et écriture
SimRunner ..> SimulationCatalog : post_run_results(run_ctx, sim_id, results_config, store, run_id)
Orchestrator ..> SimulationCatalog : step_configure_results(ctx) / step_finalize_store()
Orchestrator ..> DataStore : uses DataStore.load_variable() and managers

note right
  Noms exacts utilisés dans le dépôt : fonctions et Protocols cités
  (voir hydromodpy/workflow/orchestrator.py pour prepare_run/execute_run etc.)
end note

note bottom of Dispatch
  Pattern: Facade / Dispatcher
  Rôle: route les entrées vers le workflow approprié
end note

note bottom of Orchestrator
  Pattern: Orchestrator + Pipeline
  Rôle: enchaîne les phases standard du workflow simulation
end note

note bottom of CalibrationEngine
  Pattern: Orchestrator + Strategy
  Rôle: ask/tell, convergence, sélection d'optimiseur
end note

note right
  **DESIGN PATTERNS**

  1) Facade: CLI, API, Project
  2) Orchestrator: workflow and calibration coordinators
  3) Pipeline: ordered standard steps
  4) Registry: solver / optimizer resolution
  5) Adapter: solver backends and calibration trial execution
  6) Ports & Adapters: protocols and module boundaries
  7) Strategy: backend / optimizer selection
end note

@enduml
